00:00:03.264 --> 00:00:05.610
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:08.310
We've all loved Wilmer in
"NCIS" in recent years,

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:09.143
but before that,

00:00:09.143 --> 00:00:11.100
