00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:29.730
- [Lord] I certainly do Kelly.

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:30.839
How you doing down there?

00:00:30.839 --> 00:00:31.980
- (laughs) We're doing great.

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:32.813
- [Lord] You like that?

00:00:32.813 --> 00:00:34.255
That was one heck of
an entrance, wasn't it?

00:00:34.255 --> 00:00:35.088
- It was.

00:00:35.088 --> 00:00:35.921
- [Lord] I almost said hell.

00:00:35.921 --> 00:00:36.857
